Debug mode highlights each of the three declarators of a `declare const` statement, the first from `declare` and the others by their bare names, leaving their types plain.
== args
--debug
input/declare-const-triple.ts
== file input/declare-const-triple.ts
declare const a: number, b: string, c: boolean;
== stdout
\x1b[32mdeclare const a\x1b[0m: number, \x1b[32mb\x1b[0m: string, \x1b[32mc\x1b[0m: boolean;
== stderr
== exit 0
